# Slack 配置模板

## 基础配置

```json
{
  "name": "slack",
  "description": "Slack 工作区应用配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "slack",
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "botToken": "xoxb-YOUR-BOT-TOKEN",
    "signingSecret": "YOUR_SIGNING_SECRET",
    "appToken": "xapp-YOUR-APP-TOKEN",
    "dmPolicy": "pairing",
    "groupPolicy": "allowlist"
  },
  "features": [
    "私聊对话",
    "频道消息",
    "消息回复",
    "交互式组件"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 访问 https://api.slack.com/apps",
    "2. 创建新应用",
    "3. 配置 Bot Token Scopes",
    "4. 安装应用到工作区",
    "5. 复制 Bot Token",
    "6. 配置到 OpenClaw"
  ],
  "requiredScopes": [
    "chat:write",
    "chat:write.public",
    "im:read",
    "im:write",
    "im:history",
    "users:read"
  ]
}
```

## 高级配置

```json
{
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "botToken": "xoxb-xxx",
    "signingSecret": "xxx",
    "dmPolicy": "pairing",
    "groupPolicy": "allowlist",
    "dm": {
      "allowFrom": []
    },
    "group": {
      "allowFrom": []
    },
    "mentionPattern": "@ClawBot"
  }
}
```

## 权限 Scopes

| Scope | 说明 |
|-------|------|
| `chat:write` | 发送消息 |
| `chat:write.public` | 公开频道发送 |
| `im:read` | 读取私聊 |
| `im:write` | 发送私聊 |
| `im:history` | 私聊历史 |
| `users:read` | 读取用户信息 |

## 文件位置
`templates/channels/slack.json`
